# Backend (Spring Boot + Maven)

## Build
- Use **Maven only** (`backend/mvnw` / `backend/mvnw.cmd`). Do not add Gradle.
- Run tests: `./mvnw test` from `backend/`.

## Package layout
`com.learningplatform.{source|course|content|assessment|ai|sync|student|notification|audit|common}`

Each module: `domain`, `repository`, `service`, `api`, `mapper`. No cross-module repository access — call services.

## Domain rules
- Prefer rich domain services over anemic “God” controllers.
- Idempotency keys on async consumers (`eventId` / `jobId`).
- Structured API errors: `{ code, message, correlationId }`.

## AI
- Business services call `AiProvider` only — never OpenAI SDK directly.
- Validate LLM JSON with schema before persist.
- Persist `promptVersion`, `modelName`, `modelVersion` on every generation.

## Persistence
- Flyway migrations only. No Hibernate auto-ddl in prod profile.
- UUIDs for public IDs. Soft status enums, not string litter.

## Async
Long work (parse, embed, generate, sync) → RabbitMQ → worker. REST returns `202` + `operationId`.
